{"sections":[{"slug":"Hochschild同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hochschild同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Hochschild 同调"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong>Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是其</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">沿着流形</span> $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的张量积</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分解同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".\nHochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调又叫</span> “"},{"Local":{"url":"/迹","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">迹</span>"}},{"Plain":"”, “"},{"Local":{"url":"/余中心","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余中心</span>"}},{"Plain":"”.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调是其与</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/张量积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义其</span> <strong>Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{HH}_*(A) := A \\otimes_{A\\otimes A^{\\mathrm{op}}} A.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个定义的缺陷是它没能反映</span> Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调的</span> $S^1$-<span lang=\"zh\">对称性</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">时</span>,\n<span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{HH}_*(A) =\r\nA\\otimes_{A\\otimes A}A = \\operatorname{colim}_{S^1}^{\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathcal C)} A = A^{\\otimes S^1}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">有典范的态射</span>\n$$\r\nA \\to\\mathrm {HH}^*(A),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $S^1$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的万有态射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴中</span> $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">形状的常值图</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的余极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> $A\\colon *\\to \\mathsf {CAlg}(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $*\\to \\mathbf{B}S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">而这个余极限</span> $\\operatorname{colim}_{S^1}^{\\mathsf{CAlg}(\\mathcal C)} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $S^1=*\\sqcup_{*\\sqcup *}*$, <span lang=\"zh\">可计算为</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\mathrm {HH}_*(A) &amp;= \\operatorname{colim}_* A \\otimes_{\\operatorname{colim}_{*\\sqcup *}A}\\operatorname{colim}_* A\\\\\r\n&amp; = A\\otimes_{A\\otimes A}A.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $X = \\operatorname{Spec} A$, <span lang=\"zh\">那么作为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Spec}(\\operatorname{HH}_*(A)) = X\\times_{X\\times X} X = X^{S^1} = \\mathcal LX,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自由环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal L X$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧生成范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧生成范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调可定义为如下单纯对象的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> K-<span lang=\"zh\">理论的关系</span></h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>THH and TC are in practice computationally useful approximations to K</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Hochschild上同调","text":"Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}